  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience the perfect blend of comfort and style with Rothco's Athletic Fit T-shirts. Crafted from a super-soft cotton/poly ring spun material, these shirts are uniquely tailored to complement an athletic build. The service-inspired design features a slightly smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve opening, offering an ideal fit for those with an active lifestyle. The short sleeve tee includes a tagless label for added comfort, making it suitable for all-day wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132771",
  "description": "<p>Experience the perfect blend of comfort and style with Rothco's Athletic Fit T-shirts. Crafted from a super-soft cotton/poly ring spun material, these shirts are uniquely tailored to complement an athletic build. The service-inspired design features a slightly smaller chest, armholes, and sleeve opening, offering an ideal fit for those with an active lifestyle. The short sleeve tee includes a tagless label for added comfort, making it suitable for all-day wear. Whether you're in the service, part of a team, or just looking for everyday fashion, Rothco's Athletic Fit T-shirts are the perfect choice. Additionally, these shirts are screen printing-friendly, allowing you to customize your look effortlessly.</p>",
